<title>USA: CII Technologies IPO postponed indefinitely.</title>
<headline>CII Technologies IPO postponed indefinitely.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of CII Technologies Inc, has been indefinitely postponed &quot;due to market conditions,&quot; said the syndicate department of lead underwriter, William Blair &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The number of shares to be offered was 3.5 million and the issue was expected to price between $9 and $11 a share.</p>
</text>
